## User

Split a list into chunks of the given size; the last chunk may be shorter.

## Type

type
```haskell
chunksOf :: Int -> [a] -> [[a]]
```

## Term

```haskell
chunksOf n xs =
  let
    chunks = take n xs
  in
    chunks
```

